                      "type": "text",
                      "html": "<p>Use approved tools and protect confidential data. Give Copilot a clear goal and trusted context. Choose the right agent for the work. Review important outputs. Turn effective instructions into a reusable practice.</p><p>Your next step: choose one low-risk task this week, define what a good result looks like, and compare the time and quality with your current approach.</p>"
